			description: [
				"&7Explore the forgotten worlds that lurk beneath light and reason.&r"
				""
				" &lCongratulations, fearless explorer!&r With the power of the &5Tier 5 Rocket&r, you now have access to the &oAlex’s Caves Planets&r - mysterious realms veiled in &8shadow&8, &3depth&3, and &2ancient life&2."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &8Forlorn Hollows&r – A land of &oGuanostone ruins&r and ominous silence. Malevolent creatures stalk the caverns, and forgotten whispers echo through the darkness."
				""
				" &1Abyssal Chasm&r – Dive into an endless ocean abyss lined with sunken ruins, where the &9Deep Ones&r prowl and lost relics of a drowned age await the brave."
				""
				" &2Primordial Caves&r – Step into a prehistoric underworld, overgrown with massive flora and inhabited by creatures untouched by time. It’s a living vault of Earth’s earliest secrets."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Each of these worlds is rich with &6rare materials&r, &crelics&r, and &odark histories&r. Only those bold enough to brave their depths will unlock their true potential."
				""
				" &lFuel up. Descend. Discover the legacy left in the dark.&r"
			]
