		{
			description: [
				"&7Unlock the forgotten worlds sealed beneath shadow and time.&r"
				""
				"Prepare for your &l&0darkest, most enigmatic adventure yet&r with the &lTier 5 Rocket&r! After conquering the &5End Dimension&r, you now hold the key to &oAlex’s Caves Planets&r - &8Forlorn Hollows&8, &1Abyssal Chasm&1, and &2Primordial Caves&2. "
				""
				"These shadowed realms offer a progression unlike any other."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&8 Forlorn Hollows&r – Descend into the void of &oGuanostone&r, where cursed echoes and malevolent forces await. Navigate its claustrophobic tunnels and unravel secrets best left buried."
				""
				" &1Abyssal Chasm&r – Plunge into a &odeep oceanic rift&r lined with ancient ruins and haunted by the elusive &9Deep Ones&r. Strange relics and abyssal creatures patrol its depths."
				""
				" &2Primordial Caves&r – Wander an untouched realm of &oglowing flora&r and prehistoric giants. Here, time has stood still-yet power pulses beneath the roots of ancient trees."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Each planet holds &6rare ores&r, &7powerful mobs&r, and &omysteries that defy understanding&r. For full details, dive into the &oPlanet Progression Quests&r and uncover the path that lies ahead."
				""
				" &lThe shadows call-will you answer?&r"
			]
