		{
			description: [
				"&7Unlock the final, strangest corners of the cosmos-if you dare.&r"
				""
				"The &5Tier 6 Rocket&r launches you into the most &osurreal&r and &6hazardous&r worlds yet. These aren’t just planets-they are twisted biomes forged by chaos, teeming with &cbizarre lifeforms&r, &etoxic air&r, and &dcandy-colored nightmares&r. Welcome to the final frontier of Alex’s Caves Planets."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &bMagnetic Caves&r – Gravity bends and magnetism distorts reality here. Every step is a struggle as metallic storms swirl, structures float, and magnetic anomalies twist the laws of physics."
				""
				" &2Toxic Caves&r – A world of bubbling &aacid lakes&r, glowing mists, and venomous flora. The air itself is a weapon, and the ground beneath you resents your presence."
				""
				" &dCandy Cavity&r – Don’t be fooled by its sugar-sweet surface. This planet’s &opastel horror&r conceals eerie creatures, &ounnatural formations&r, and a biome as beautiful as it is unsettling."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Each of these worlds holds &6exotic materials&r, &5unseen loot&r, and &ostrange phenomena&r that test both your survival skills and your sanity."
				""
				" &lStrap in-your journey into the cosmic unknown has only just begun.&r"
			]
			hide_dependent_lines: true
			id: "20BB2E7B405CA851"
