			description: [
				"&7Your expedition into the bizarre begins now.&r"
				""
				" Congratulations, fearless explorer! With the &5Tier 6 Rocket&r crafted and fueled, you're ready to brave the most &osurreally dangerous&r planets of the Alex’s Caves system. These aren’t ordinary frontiers-they’re the &cmad fringes of the galaxy&r, where science blurs into imagination."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &bMagnetic Caves&r – A realm of gravitational oddities and &oelectromagnetic chaos&r. Navigate floating terrain, twisting tunnels, and magnetic creatures that pull at your gear and your sanity."
				""
				" &2Toxic Caves&r – Thick, acidic fog clouds every step, while &nradioactive flora&r and mutant beasts turn survival into a constant battle. One breath too deep could be your last."
				""
				" &dCandy Cavity&r – A saccharine nightmare with &opsychotropic caverns&r and &ounnatural colors&r. It's sweet-until it isn’t. Licowitches and twisted candy beasts guard this planet's unnatural beauty."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Each of these planets offers &6rare resources&r, &5exotic loot&r, and &5secrets waiting to be unraveled&r. But beware: what you find may change how you see the universe."
				""
				" &lStrange. Hostile. Unforgettable.&r  "
				" The final leg of your journey begins now-&owill you endure the madness and master the unknown?&r"
			]
